# The sdist: the package, the C sources setup.py compiles, and the tests with the scripts and data they use (the
# wheel carries the compiled module and the bundled lattices, not these).
graft src/anemoi_datasets_codecs/icon_lattice/csrc
graft tests
graft scripts
include LICENSE README.md setup.py
global-exclude __pycache__ *.py[cod] *.so
